            <div class="gk-card">
                <div class="gk-card-head"><h3>Rekap Laporan per Outlet/Hari</h3><span class="gk-muted">F2 menyusul: tabel No/Tgl/Outlet/Pendapatan/Biaya/Laba/Margin</span></div>
